{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10126050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10126050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1012605001:1":{"text":"아빠, 이 형, 누나들은 누구예요?","source_cn":"阿爸，这些大哥哥大姐姐是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE092794B11DB9B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012605002:1":{"text":"자, 이 분들은 숲 은신처 마을의 은인이란다. 몬스터를 없애 주셨어.","source_cn":"来，孩子，我们一起感谢这些林隐村的恩人，是他们清理了魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C99B03DA4C18B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012605003:1":{"text":"형, 누나, 숲 은신처 마을을 도와줘서 고마워요!","source_cn":"谢谢大哥哥大姐姐们！林隐村给你们添麻烦了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F6D9F709EDE9A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012605004:1":{"text":"이건 우리의 의무인걸. 나중에 멀린 님에게 감사 인사를 해.\n브라이언, 방금 동굴에서 다른 사람은 못 찾았어?","source_cn":"这是我们的职责，事后要感谢就谢梅林吧。\\n布莱恩，刚才...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x203701A814AA43AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이건 우리의 의무인걸. 나중에 멀린 님에게 감사 인사를 해.\n브라이언, 방금 동굴에서 다른 사람은 못 찾았어?","female":"이건 우리의 의무인걸. 나중에 멀린 님에게 감사 인사를 해.\n브라이언, 방금 동굴에서 다른 사람은 못 찾았어?","variant_male_record_index":"111873","variant_female_record_index":"111874","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012605005:1":{"text":"찾았어요. 그 사람들은 모두 겁에 질려서 놀라게 하지 않으려고 아무 말도 안 했고요.","source_cn":"有，那些人都很害怕，为了不惊动他们我没有声张。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2754AD891F22FBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012605006:1":{"text":"너와 함께 탈출한 마을 주민들은 모두 여기에 있니?","source_cn":"孩子，和你一起逃出来的村民都在这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05162FA681EB0D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012605007:1":{"text":"네! 다친 사람이 있어서 약초를 구하러 나온 거예요!","source_cn":"是的！有人受伤了，我是为了找药草才出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DBD16B277A2686E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012605008:1":{"text":"방금 이 아이의 담대함을 보았어요. 용감한 아들을 두셨군요, 이반.","source_cn":"我们看到了他刚才的无畏，你有个勇敢的儿子，伊凡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E4B1C116622EC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012605009:1":{"text":"네, 이 아이는 적어도 저보다 더 유능한 촌장이 될 겁니다.","source_cn":"是啊，这孩子将来一定会成为个好村长，至少比我要称职……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9C8D626D502472B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1012605010:1":{"text":"켈빈, 우리를 다른 마을 주민들에게 데려다 줘. 함께 약초를 찾아보자.","source_cn":"带我们去找其他村民吧，药草的事我们一起想办法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ADDC6A1892D84EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:凯尔温":{"text":"켈빈","source":"凯尔温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村长伊凡":{"text":"촌장 이반","source":"村长伊凡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":4}}